WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:16.820
King Jolliginki was very upset.

2
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.342
"Bring the prisoners back!"

3
00:00:19.782 --> 00:00:20.863
he roared loudly.

4
00:00:21.503 --> 00:00:27.028
His guards, servants, and even poor Queen Ermintrude were sent out into the jungle.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.561
Dr. Dolittle and the animals could hear the guards behind them.

6
00:00:32.581 --> 00:00:34.041
"We'll get them!"

7
00:00:34.542 --> 00:00:35.202
one shouted.

8
00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:37.922
"They're sure to get lost in our jungle!"

9
00:00:38.343 --> 00:00:39.083
cried another.

10
00:00:39.103 --> 00:00:42.264
"Let's put them back in the dungeon!"

11
00:00:42.804 --> 00:00:43.804
the guards roared.

12
00:00:43.824 --> 00:00:47.145
"What if they get us?"

13
00:00:47.545 --> 00:00:49.426
cried Dab-Dab and Gub-Gub.

14
00:00:49.806 --> 00:00:52.286
Jip growled at them, "Don't worry!

15
00:00:52.627 --> 00:00:55.747
Chee-Chee knows the jungle better than any human!"

16
00:01:00.708 --> 00:01:04.151
The doctor and the animals soon came to a crossroad.

17
00:01:04.171 --> 00:01:06.732
"Which way do we go, Chee-Chee?"

18
00:01:07.213 --> 00:01:08.073
asked the doctor.

19
00:01:08.093 --> 00:01:12.236
"This way," Chee-Chee pointed toward the dark shadows.

20
00:01:12.997 --> 00:01:14.638
Gub-Gub began crying.

21
00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:18.601
"I don't want to go that way."

22
00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:24.425
"Gub-Gub, you must learn to trust your friends," Dr.

23
00:01:24.465 --> 00:01:25.806
Dolittle said kindly.

24
00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.828
The pig still did not want to go.

25
00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.061
"Stay and get caught by Jolliginki's guards!

26
00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:34.361
I don't care!"

27
00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:35.582
growled Jip.

28
00:01:35.602 --> 00:01:38.082
"Jip is right.

29
00:01:38.643 --> 00:01:43.144
If you don't come with us, the king's guards will get you," said Dr.

30
00:01:43.184 --> 00:01:48.325
Dolittle. "I'll fly beside you, Gub-Gub," promised Polynesia.

31
00:01:50.006 --> 00:01:51.506
The hours passed quickly.

32
00:01:52.106 --> 00:01:54.887
There was no sign of the doctor or the animals.

33
00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.848
"Where did they go?"

34
00:01:58.056 --> 00:01:59.056
one guard asked.

35
00:01:59.717 --> 00:02:01.517
None of them were shouting anymore.

36
00:02:02.457 --> 00:02:06.278
The king would be very angry if the prisoners weren't found.

37
00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.740
Chee-Chee knew a hiding place.

38
00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:16.461
No man, not even the monkeys, knew about it.

39
00:02:16.481 --> 00:02:18.542
"What's happening?"

40
00:02:19.122 --> 00:02:19.762
Jip asked.

41
00:02:19.782 --> 00:02:27.385
"They're gone for now," answered Chee-Chee.

42
00:02:27.745 --> 00:02:30.427
"What is it now, Gub-Gub?"

43
00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:33.469
Jip tried to make his voice sound nice.

44
00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.432
"I'm hungry," the pig replied.

45
00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:39.373
"Stay here.

46
00:02:39.393 --> 00:02:43.316
I'll get us some food," Polynesia said and flew off.

47
00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.099
Polynesia knew the jungle very well.

48
00:02:47.979 --> 00:02:50.461
She found plenty of food and drinks for them.

49
00:02:50.481 --> 00:02:52.663
"What's that, Polynesia?"

50
00:02:53.383 --> 00:02:54.324
Gub-Gub pointed.

51
00:02:55.432 --> 00:02:56.633
"This is a coconut.

52
00:02:56.973 --> 00:03:00.534
It's really delicious," Polynesia answered.

53
00:03:01.515 --> 00:03:04.176
Polynesia flew up higher and higher.

54
00:03:04.956 --> 00:03:06.757
Then she dropped the coconut.

55
00:03:07.457 --> 00:03:11.779
SPLAT! "Drink the coconut milk," Dr.

56
00:03:11.819 --> 00:03:12.799
Dolittle told them.

57
00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:15.220
Soon it was time to leave the tree.

58
00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.761
"Come on, everyone!

59
00:03:16.981 --> 00:03:19.282
We must be on our way," Dr.

60
00:03:19.322 --> 00:03:20.102
Dolittle said.

61
00:03:21.302 --> 00:03:24.704
Back at the palace, the king was not happy at all.

62
00:03:25.172 --> 00:03:26.513
"How could they escape?

63
00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.554
How? This is MY jungle!"

64
00:03:29.975 --> 00:03:30.975
the king boomed.

65
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:34.717
All the guards were afraid of the furious king.

66
00:03:34.737 --> 00:03:36.818
"Go back to the jungle!

67
00:03:37.319 --> 00:03:39.280
Don't return until you've found them!"

68
00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:40.881
the king commanded.

69
00:03:42.101 --> 00:03:46.964
Dr. Dolittle and the animals did not know the guards were still following them.

70
00:03:46.984 --> 00:03:50.326
"How much longer, Chee-Chee?"

71
00:03:51.006 --> 00:03:52.627
asked the very tired pig.

72
00:03:52.647 --> 00:03:54.268
"Soon, my friend.

73
00:03:54.604 --> 00:03:57.426
We are almost there," Chee-Chee replied.

74
00:03:57.446 --> 00:04:02.830
"At least we don't have to worry about the king's guards," Jip added.

75
00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.391
Everyone thought they were safe.

76
00:04:06.692 --> 00:04:11.195
Dr. Dolittle and the animals were very tired but they didn't stop.

77
00:04:11.215 --> 00:04:14.317
"We must help the monkeys," Dr.

78
00:04:14.358 --> 00:04:15.558
Dolittle kept saying.

79
00:04:15.578 --> 00:04:17.640
"But I'm so tired.

80
00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:23.624
I'm hungry and sleepy and complained Gub-Gub.

81
00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:26.909
Suddenly, there was a noise from the trees.

82
00:04:26.929 --> 00:04:29.511
"What is it, Chee-Chee?"

83
00:04:30.111 --> 00:04:31.091
whispered the doctor.

84
00:04:31.111 --> 00:04:35.393
"I think we're being watched," Chee-Chee answered quietly.

85
00:04:36.314 --> 00:04:37.734
The trees moved again.

86
00:04:38.695 --> 00:04:40.536
Something was coming out toward them.

87
00:04:40.556 --> 00:04:43.717
"I'm scared," squeaked Gub-Gub.

88
00:04:43.737 --> 00:04:47.439
"So am I, Gub-Gub," the doctor replied.
